## Astro frontend

The independent Astro site is in `frontend/`.

```sh
bun install --cwd frontend
bun run --cwd frontend dev
bun run --cwd frontend check
bun run --cwd frontend format
bun run --cwd frontend build
```

The production artifact is the provider-neutral `frontend/dist/` directory.
{% if frontend_playwright %}
Install a Playwright browser with `bunx --cwd frontend playwright install chromium`,
then run the end-to-end suite with `bun run --cwd frontend test:e2e`.
{% endif %}
